that will be your doom.

04:58:08.260 --> 04:58:14.770
You might want to refer it to the Mask of Doom.

04:58:15.290 --> 04:58:16.730
It's the Mask of Destiny.

04:58:18.780 --> 04:58:20.380
It's true name is

04:58:20.380 --> 04:58:21.780
the Kanoe Evoki.

04:58:22.440 --> 04:58:23.300
The Mask?

04:58:23.660 --> 04:58:35.990
The Kanoe Evoki has the ability

04:58:36.850 --> 04:58:38.190
to freeze an opponent

04:58:38.190 --> 04:58:39.150
in the Columns of Light.

04:58:39.330 --> 04:58:40.410
Make an opponent feel

04:58:40.410 --> 04:58:41.670
feelings of peace.

04:58:45.820 --> 04:58:50.510
That is why none of you

04:58:50.510 --> 04:58:51.370
are feeling it.

04:58:51.550 --> 04:59:00.300
You tell us.

04:59:00.340 --> 04:59:06.310
I did not want to hear this.

04:59:08.460 --> 04:59:13.570
What can you do with that Mask of Lust?

04:59:13.750 --> 04:59:14.810
You're just a Matoran.

04:59:14.810 --> 04:59:17.660
There are many things, Makuta.

04:59:18.580 --> 04:59:20.160
And the first of them

04:59:21.560 --> 04:59:22.640
is your demise.

04:59:52.390 --> 04:59:54.930
Dwarri, Dwarri, Dwarri, Dwarri.

05:00:06.600 --> 05:00:07.400
There is an illusion.

05:00:09.240 --> 05:00:10.080
Light will

05:00:10.080 --> 05:00:11.660
no matter how deep

05:00:11.660 --> 05:00:13.580
the darkness, a light

05:00:13.580 --> 05:00:14.580
shines within!

05:00:37.590 --> 05:01:08.920
I am Entakenuva,

05:01:10.060 --> 05:01:11.240
Toa of Light.

05:01:11.520 --> 05:01:26.360
I don't get it.

05:01:27.890 --> 05:01:29.890
What happened to the Matoran I was looking at

05:01:29.890 --> 05:01:30.730
a few seconds earlier?

05:01:35.350 --> 05:01:36.710
Makuta never understood

05:01:36.870 --> 05:01:37.850
anybody without

05:01:38.690 --> 05:01:40.390
discovering their personality first.

05:01:40.670 --> 05:01:47.580
Wait a minute.

05:01:48.100 --> 05:01:49.280
I hear more footsteps.

05:02:02.170 --> 05:02:03.630
You're tiny compared to him.

05:02:04.850 --> 05:02:06.150
Actually, he's a little larger

05:02:06.150 --> 05:02:06.830
than he should be.

05:02:08.710 --> 05:02:09.190
Makuta,

05:02:09.730 --> 05:02:10.650
it is time.

05:02:12.990 --> 05:02:14.170
Dr. Senor.

05:02:14.430 --> 05:02:20.580
Take a good look around this world,

05:02:21.540 --> 05:02:22.020
Makuta.

05:02:22.260 --> 05:02:42.160
I have a feeling that they are tricking us somehow.

05:02:42.560 --> 05:02:44.060
Is this some kind of illusion?

05:02:44.820 --> 05:02:46.080
Some way to trick

05:02:46.740 --> 05:02:47.680
the Master of Shadows?

05:02:58.460 --> 05:03:01.060
It is a way that will show

05:03:01.060 --> 05:03:04.760
who is the dominant one

05:03:04.760 --> 05:03:07.710
of the family, Makuta.

05:03:08.470 --> 05:03:09.490
You mean...

05:03:09.490 --> 05:03:11.270
Yes, we are battling.

05:03:11.570 --> 05:03:20.080
Prepare yourself, Makuta.

05:03:20.320 --> 05:03:26.960
This will be the end for you.

05:03:27.200 --> 05:03:41.490
Are you ready, Makuta?

05:03:41.810 --> 05:03:47.130
Who's first?

05:03:49.220 --> 05:03:51.740
Dwarri, Bwaka, Kanra, Vinkai,

05:03:51.900 --> 05:03:53.640
and both Nuna and Rama.

05:03:55.890 --> 05:03:57.970
Interesting. All right, Lin.

05:03:58.030 --> 05:03:58.610
Let's go.

05:04:00.570 --> 05:04:02.710
So, are we ready?

05:04:08.260 --> 05:04:08.660
Yes.

05:04:08.660 --> 05:04:09.840
Now, prepare yourself, Makuta.

05:04:11.620 --> 05:04:13.000
Think about what you already did.

05:04:13.480 --> 05:04:14.960
You're going to give up the battle.

05:04:17.480 --> 05:04:19.560
Oh, they will win. I'm sure of it.

05:04:20.560 --> 05:04:21.500
Sure of losing?

05:04:28.350 --> 05:04:30.050
Actually, this is my weakest victory.

05:04:31.210 --> 05:04:32.330
I don't mean to do that.

05:04:40.250 --> 05:04:40.530
Target!

05:04:41.130 --> 05:04:43.080
We just did.

05:04:43.540 --> 05:04:45.000
Dr. Senor, do you want to hold back?

05:04:45.240 --> 05:04:46.360
No, I'll help you out.

05:04:47.680 --> 05:04:48.760
Even though I don't need some,

05:04:48.880 --> 05:04:50.200
it's good to have somebody with me.

05:05:05.380 --> 05:05:05.860
Ready.

05:05:05.980 --> 05:06:23.560
I wonder, Makuta, why you were so weak.

05:06:23.760 --> 05:10:31.560
You talk with crackly voices.

05:10:32.980 --> 05:10:33.460
Ah!

05:16:46.920 --> 05:16:48.540
Well, once you defeat them,

05:16:48.600 --> 05:16:49.700
you will never find me.

05:16:50.620 --> 05:16:52.320
You don't have a body, do you?

05:16:52.980 --> 05:16:54.240
Not that wimpy thing.

05:16:58.550 --> 05:16:59.390
Okay, then send it out.

05:16:59.410 --> 05:17:00.590
Then we'll tear it to shreds.

05:17:00.930 --> 05:17:01.910
Like a napkin.

05:17:08.960 --> 05:17:15.460
So, where's that wimpy body I was talking about?

05:17:18.720 --> 05:17:19.280
You've transformed!

05:17:25.140 --> 05:17:25.880
That is right.

05:17:27.660 --> 05:17:29.520
I'm in time for you to run along now,

05:17:29.640 --> 05:17:30.920
and let me conquer the world.

05:17:32.630 --> 05:17:34.950
You can't possibly defeat me

05:17:34.950 --> 05:17:36.170
and my Rahkshi.

05:17:36.850 --> 05:17:39.090
Nobody has been able to knock the Rahkshi out.

05:17:41.370 --> 05:17:43.350
And they're at full health

05:17:43.350 --> 05:17:44.490
right now, aren't they?

05:17:44.910 --> 05:17:46.670
Yes, Dad. We are still at full health.

05:17:48.650 --> 05:17:50.230
You're just trying to taunt us.

05:17:50.290 --> 05:17:50.910
I know this.

05:17:52.430 --> 05:17:53.490
Oh, is that true?

05:17:53.910 --> 05:17:57.700
I'll take you down.

05:17:57.940 --> 05:18:00.860
Wait, Dr. Senor. I'll take care of the Barag.

05:18:01.320 --> 05:18:02.320
You stand by.

05:18:06.930 --> 05:18:08.410
Rahkshi, step back a little.

05:18:10.870 --> 05:18:11.950
I'll take care of the Barag all by myself.

05:18:12.250 --> 05:18:31.790
Is that true?

05:18:32.290 --> 05:19:00.900
Oh, but too bad you won't be able to get my weak spot anyway.

05:19:01.300 --> 05:19:02.780
Because I'm protecting it.

05:19:02.920 --> 05:19:18.810
You're extremely powerful.

05:19:19.370 --> 05:19:24.200
But you must get used to mine once you get used to mine.

05:19:25.550 --> 05:19:27.570
I can. I'm not something as large as you.

05:19:34.020 --> 05:19:34.460
Slash.

05:19:35.420 --> 05:19:36.420
Blade, extend.

05:19:38.060 --> 05:19:46.270
Dad, this one hurts.

05:19:54.630 --> 05:19:56.250
You'll never take my mask off.

05:19:56.330 --> 05:19:57.330
Only when my head comes off.

05:20:07.710 --> 05:20:08.590
Slash. Slash.

05:20:08.710 --> 05:20:46.550
Be hard.

05:20:50.740 --> 05:20:53.800
That one hurt.

05:20:56.810 --> 05:20:58.470
I hate this fool Takanuva.

05:21:00.030 --> 05:21:01.830
You're gonna hate me even more, Makuta.

05:21:02.430 --> 05:21:03.450
Because you know what?

05:21:05.130 --> 05:21:08.830
Dr. Senor is waiting in your powerup for a hyper supernova beam.

05:21:08.950 --> 05:21:12.070
To finish you off for the final time.

05:21:28.140 --> 05:21:28.620
Twins.

05:21:34.480 --> 05:21:37.640
I'm about to give you a slash that you'll never forget.

05:21:37.980 --> 05:21:45.600
Shall I get out my Asanui?

05:21:46.180 --> 05:21:46.660
Asanui?

05:21:47.440 --> 05:21:47.920
Yes.

05:21:51.440 --> 05:21:55.060
This fool Takanuva keeps getting me things.

05:21:55.940 --> 05:21:56.420
I'm gonna take you down.

05:21:56.420 --> 05:21:58.560
I don't get in the Exo Tower.

05:21:59.120 --> 05:21:59.600
Huh?

05:22:00.840 --> 05:22:03.560
I'm the only one that doesn't belong in the Exo Tower.

05:22:04.020 --> 05:22:05.460
I have the Asanui.

05:22:07.140 --> 05:22:08.800
Oh, so that is true.

05:22:09.120 --> 05:22:12.350
But what can you do with that?

05:22:12.450 --> 05:22:14.450
Race around and, um,

05:22:15.470 --> 05:22:17.110
just be a coward?

05:22:17.430 --> 05:22:17.910
No.

05:22:18.050 --> 05:22:20.610
I can use one of my most powerful attacks with it.

05:22:21.490 --> 05:22:22.550
Oh, is that so?

05:22:23.510 --> 05:22:24.510
Oh, go on.

05:22:24.550 --> 05:22:25.490
Show it to us then.

05:22:26.230 --> 05:22:27.530
I will once I'm in.

05:22:33.110 --> 05:22:36.290
I meant for that to be something annoying to you.

05:22:37.970 --> 05:22:38.850
Well, it wasn't.

05:22:39.490 --> 05:22:40.590
Too bad, Makuta.

05:22:40.630 --> 05:22:41.830
You're losing all your...

05:22:42.670 --> 05:22:43.950
what you used to be.

05:23:11.780 --> 05:23:13.340
Who dares to challenge me?

05:23:13.500 --> 05:23:23.690
You're gonna have to get off of us.

05:23:26.310 --> 05:23:27.530
So you wanna fight, huh?

05:23:41.100 --> 05:23:42.380
You're going to be defeated.

05:23:42.780 --> 05:23:43.300
Why?

05:23:43.720 --> 05:23:45.880
You cannot possibly defeat us.

05:23:46.120 --> 05:23:49.770
I failed.

05:23:54.820 --> 05:23:55.340
Attack.

05:23:56.800 --> 05:23:57.320
Yes.

05:23:57.380 --> 05:23:58.360
Let me try.

05:23:58.360 --> 05:23:58.540
You're blind.

05:23:58.740 --> 05:24:10.880
You don't fight good.

05:24:12.720 --> 05:24:14.380
You're asking for it, Makuta.

05:24:14.680 --> 05:24:43.250
Dr. Snior, power up for Hyper Supernova Beam.

05:24:44.110 --> 05:24:45.110
Yes, Kakanuba.

05:24:50.690 --> 05:24:51.730
So, Makuta.

05:24:53.340 --> 05:24:56.180
You have grown more powerful since I last saw you.

05:24:58.440 --> 05:24:59.920
I have never seen you.

05:25:00.340 --> 05:25:03.040
Well, maybe you have.

05:25:03.500 --> 05:25:05.580
I've been in your dreams for years.

05:25:12.940 --> 05:25:14.080
Yes, I have.

05:25:14.300 --> 05:25:18.280
I've never seen it totally.

05:25:22.720 --> 05:25:23.680
Well, what about Kopaka?

05:25:23.980 --> 05:25:25.420
She's too dark to be.

05:25:29.000 --> 05:25:34.260
So, Makuta, let's battle.

05:25:51.820 --> 05:25:52.380
First move.

05:25:55.330 --> 05:27:30.920
She got dripping off my mask. That is power.

05:27:31.660 --> 05:27:33.760
And you would never understand it, Makuta.

05:29:35.610 --> 05:29:37.150
Well, I'll bridge over your life.

05:29:38.510 --> 05:29:40.090
Just give me a second.

05:29:59.660 --> 05:30:01.320
It's all over, Dr. Sn...

05:30:02.180 --> 05:30:02.700
Takanuva.

05:30:04.000 --> 05:30:08.110
Prepare to be destroyed.

05:30:10.270 --> 05:30:52.370
The time has come.

05:30:52.610 --> 05:30:55.450
The time when the Super Family finally defeats you.

05:30:55.730 --> 05:31:00.740
Come destroy me,

05:31:00.780 --> 05:31:01.820
for I am nothing.

05:31:02.720 --> 05:31:03.420
That is true.

05:31:04.540 --> 05:31:06.600
But so many years in darkness

05:31:06.600 --> 05:31:07.980
must have made you blind.

05:31:08.420 --> 05:31:10.960
I remember back in the days of the Power Team

05:31:10.960 --> 05:31:13.080
when the most violent and evil attack

05:31:13.080 --> 05:31:14.600
of that time

05:31:14.600 --> 05:31:21.630
the Portal of Chaos

05:31:21.630 --> 05:31:23.690
and the evil brother used it.

05:31:24.190 --> 05:31:25.890
I have grown so powerful

05:31:25.890 --> 05:31:26.730
over the years that

05:31:27.810 --> 05:31:29.890
I feel I now have the ability

05:31:29.890 --> 05:31:31.030
to harness that energy

05:31:31.030 --> 05:31:33.830
when I discovered that Hyper Supernova Beam

05:31:33.830 --> 05:31:36.030
is powerful enough to create that attack

05:31:36.030 --> 05:31:36.650
on its own.

05:31:37.930 --> 05:31:40.110
That means that we now have the ability

05:31:40.110 --> 05:31:41.810
to imprison you forever, Makuta.

05:31:41.950 --> 05:31:43.890
Let me tell you a saying that a wise man

05:31:43.890 --> 05:31:44.290
once said.

05:31:44.630 --> 05:31:47.570
Men wear masks upon which they carve portraits

05:31:47.570 --> 05:31:49.590
of what they want to be

05:31:50.930 --> 05:31:51.450
like

05:31:51.450 --> 05:31:53.710
or think they ought to be.

05:31:54.510 --> 05:31:55.730
Opportunity, like fortune,

05:31:55.870 --> 05:31:56.930
does not change a man.

05:31:57.190 --> 05:31:58.330
It unmasks him.

05:31:58.430 --> 05:32:01.170
What lies under the mask may surprise you

05:32:01.170 --> 05:32:02.830
as it often surprised the person,

05:32:02.950 --> 05:32:04.470
but it was always there.

05:32:05.170 --> 05:32:06.570
Let's see what you

05:32:06.570 --> 05:32:08.010
truly look like.

05:32:09.920 --> 05:33:11.810
So much smoke.

05:33:12.150 --> 05:34:36.520
You found my true form.

05:34:36.680 --> 05:34:41.230
I will make you strong enough.

05:34:41.470 --> 05:34:47.780
I am the void

05:34:47.780 --> 05:35:08.910
of Makuta. Challenge me.

05:35:10.250 --> 05:35:11.310
Yes, Makuta.

05:35:11.450 --> 05:35:12.690
This will be the

05:35:12.690 --> 05:35:13.870
deciding moment

05:35:13.870 --> 05:35:16.410
in our final battle.

05:35:17.430 --> 05:35:19.110
Why don't you stare

05:35:19.110 --> 05:35:21.010
onto us? I do not bear it.

05:35:21.610 --> 05:35:23.010
You are to fight

05:35:23.010 --> 05:35:24.050
the Rahkshi first.

05:35:24.970 --> 05:35:26.450
Oh, so are we.

05:35:27.230 --> 05:35:28.950
Right then, we're going to

05:35:28.950 --> 05:35:31.050
strip them of their power.

05:35:31.690 --> 05:35:32.970
Oh, is that so?

05:35:34.870 --> 05:35:36.850
So what do you think you can do

05:35:36.850 --> 05:35:39.090
with that little stack of light and mask of light

05:35:39.090 --> 05:35:40.630
and Doctor Senora's power?

05:35:41.230 --> 05:35:41.730
Well,

05:35:42.890 --> 05:35:44.490
it's pretty much evil

05:35:44.490 --> 05:35:46.510
when it's pretty much

05:35:47.370 --> 05:35:49.150
obvious what we're going to do.

05:35:51.930 --> 05:35:52.430
So,

05:35:53.510 --> 05:35:54.910
you give in to my

05:35:54.970 --> 05:35:55.710
power already?

05:35:55.890 --> 05:35:57.710
No, I don't, Makuta.

05:35:58.010 --> 05:36:01.240
All right.

05:36:05.140 --> 05:36:14.840
Let us battle.

05:36:16.220 --> 05:36:17.540
Dun-dun-dun-dun-dun.

05:36:30.930 --> 05:36:31.610
Tura!

05:36:33.370 --> 05:44:17.990
Challenge the void.

05:44:25.530 --> 05:44:26.790
I feel you. Nothing.

05:49:44.110 --> 05:51:10.570
It's time to end this

05:51:10.570 --> 05:51:12.330
Takanuva. I agree.

05:51:12.650 --> 05:51:14.750
I'll use the power of the Vahid to call

05:51:14.750 --> 05:51:16.510
on all the power

05:51:16.510 --> 05:51:18.050
good has and had,

05:51:18.210 --> 05:51:19.690
including God's

05:51:19.690 --> 05:51:21.610
and his son's power.

05:51:22.890 --> 05:51:24.430
I'll call on all the

05:51:24.430 --> 05:51:26.110
final beams and spirits

05:51:26.110 --> 05:51:27.390
of the Super Family.

05:51:28.570 --> 05:51:30.210
Combine your collected power

05:51:30.670 --> 05:51:32.610
with mine, and I'll fire it off

05:51:32.610 --> 05:51:33.870
with the Hyper Supernova Beam.

05:51:34.170 --> 05:52:22.680
...of me strength.

05:52:36.860 --> 05:52:39.540
It is impossible to defeat

05:52:39.540 --> 05:52:40.840
the spirit of destruction.

05:52:41.340 --> 05:52:43.180
I know that, Makuta,

05:52:43.340 --> 05:52:46.240
but you can never dream of this energy,

05:52:46.420 --> 05:52:47.860
for it is

05:52:48.600 --> 05:52:49.600
everyone's power.

05:52:49.920 --> 05:52:52.500
You do not seem to get it,

05:52:52.520 --> 05:52:53.580
Toa of Light.

05:52:54.360 --> 05:52:56.100
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.

05:52:56.240 --> 05:52:57.920
Poor Doctor Senor.

05:52:58.160 --> 05:52:59.540
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.

05:53:01.080 --> 05:53:02.480
Super Chaotic

05:53:02.480 --> 05:53:04.410
Black Hole Beam of Destruction!

05:53:12.070 --> 05:53:12.770
Combined

05:53:12.770 --> 05:53:14.810
with all good's

05:53:14.810 --> 05:53:16.670
power. Passed.

05:53:16.670 --> 05:54:40.680
Doctor Senor, the end.

05:54:40.860 --> 05:54:44.960
It's what you think.

05:54:45.120 --> 05:55:17.150
Rise, Makuta.

